---
title: "Habits"
description: "The good habits I spend time on, tracked over time."
date: 2026-08-01
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Habits
  order: 5
---

<p>A running record of habits I'm spending time on. Each one gets its own page with a table and trend chart; this page is the combined timeline across all of them.</p>

{% if habitsIndex.list | length %}
<div class="habit-grid">
  {% for habit in habitsIndex.list %}
    <a class="habit-card" href="{{ habit.url | url }}">
      <span class="habit-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ habit.icon }}</span>
      <span class="habit-card__name">{{ habit.name }}</span>
      <span class="habit-card__meta">{{ habit.sessionCount }} session{% if habit.sessionCount != 1 %}s{% endif %} logged</span>
      {% if habit.latest %}
        <span class="habit-card__latest">
          Last: {{ habit.latest[habit.primaryMetric.key] | formatMetric(habit.primaryMetric) }}{% if habit.secondaryMetric %} · {{ habit.latest[habit.secondaryMetric.key] | formatMetric(habit.secondaryMetric) }} {{ habit.latest[habit.secondaryMetric.key] | pluralizeLabel(habit.secondaryMetric.label) }}{% endif %}
        </span>
      {% endif %}
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Recent activity</h2>
<div class="habit-table-wrap">
  <table class="habit-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Habit</th>
        <th scope="col">Date</th>
        <th scope="col">Time</th>
        <th scope="col">Result</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in habitsIndex.timeline %}
        <tr>
          <td><a href="{{ item.url | url }}">{{ item.icon }} {{ item.habitName }}</a></td>
          <td>{{ item.date | readableIsoDate }}</td>
          <td>{{ item.time }}</td>
          <td>{{ item.primaryDisplay }}{% if item.secondaryDisplay %} · {{ item.secondaryDisplay }} {{ item.secondaryLabel }}{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
{% else %}
<p>No habits tracked yet.</p>
{% endif %}
